# Super Villain Lockup has flash: Bot1 casts it as Bot2 attacks with two of its three Ornithopters. "Exile target tapped
# creature an opponent controls" may not target the third, untapped Ornithopter (refused) but exiles an attacking, tapped
# one until the Lockup leaves the battlefield (CR 610.3). On turn five Bot1 destroys the Lockup with Disenchant and the
# Ornithopter returns to the battlefield under its owner's control.

